" Obsidian vimrc — loaded by the 'Vimrc Support' community plugin.
"
" Scope: PURE VIM ONLY. CodeMirror 6 vim doesn't support
"   - `let mapleader` (ignored)
"   - `set langmap` (ignored)
"   - `noremap`/`nnoremap`/`xnoremap` family (only `nmap`/`vmap`/`imap`)
"   - Multi-key <Space>-leader sequences fire unreliably.
" so the leader-prefix file/edit binds went to hotkeys.json (Obsidian's
" app-level Ctrl-chord system, works in all modes uniformly).

nmap <Esc> :nohlsearch<CR>
vmap p     "_dP
" Increment/decrement moved off <C-a>/<C-x> to free <C-a> for select-all.
nmap +     <C-a>
nmap -     <C-x>
nmap <C-a> ggVG
nmap <Up>    <Nop>
nmap <Down>  <Nop>
nmap <Left>  <Nop>
nmap <Right> <Nop>
